                            <comment id="16712865" author="alex_pl" created="Fri, 7 Dec 2018 13:37:09 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=ilantukh&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;ilantukh&quot;&gt;ilantukh&lt;/a&gt;, if we don&apos;t check WAL record pageId tag in tracker anymore, we also can do some cleanup and delete code, which was written to check this tag:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;code-comment&quot;&gt;// Set &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;new&lt;/span&gt; fullPageId after recycle or after &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;new&lt;/span&gt; page init, because pageId tag is changed.
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;if&lt;/span&gt; (record &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;instanceof&lt;/span&gt; RecycleRecord)
    page.fullPageId(&lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;new&lt;/span&gt; FullPageId(((RecycleRecord)record).newPageId(), grpId));
&lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;else&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;if&lt;/span&gt; (record &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;instanceof&lt;/span&gt; InitNewPageRecord)
    page.fullPageId(&lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;new&lt;/span&gt; FullPageId(((InitNewPageRecord)record).newPageId(), grpId));
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;and:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
page.fullPageId(fullPageId);
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In &lt;tt&gt;applyWalRecord&lt;/tt&gt; method.&lt;/p&gt;

