                            <comment id="16728615" author="amashenkov" created="Tue, 25 Dec 2018 08:16:06 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=agoncharuk&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;agoncharuk&quot;&gt;agoncharuk&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=ilantukh&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;ilantukh&quot;&gt;ilantukh&lt;/a&gt;,&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Guys, I&apos;ve some failed mvcc tests that are muted with a link to this ticket.&lt;br/&gt;
 After merge with latest master, I&apos;ve found these tests are still failed with same symptom &quot;smth goes wrong with padeId.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Looking at the PR I&apos;ve found PageIdUtils.tag() method usage was changed to correct PageIdUtils.flag() for page type checks,&lt;br/&gt;
 but seems, similar fix should be applies to AbstractFreeList (line:500)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;preformatted panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;preformattedContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;else if (PageIdUtils.flag(pageId) != PageIdAllocator.FLAG_DATA)&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;with applying similar fix to this line makes mvcc test passed.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

